keywords: [earth observation, remote sensing, drought, trend analysis, burned area, landscape ecology]
abstract: >-
  Earth-observation landscape indicators from open data: spectral indices and
  cloud masking, seasonal climate anomalies, per-pixel trend tests, burned-area
  frequency, land-cover composition, diversity and fragmentation.
